<span>In registrazione si indicano, ove applicabile, i settori, i sottosettori e le tipologie di soggetto pertinenti.</span>
<a class="print:hidden" href="https://github.com/AndreaTierno-stack/nis2-knowledge-it/blob/main/wiki/sources/D.Lgs.%20138-2024%20(Decreto%20NIS).md?plain=1#L26">Apri la scheda</a>
<span class="hidden print:block" data-testid="source-url">https://github.com/AndreaTierno-stack/nis2-knowledge-it/blob/main/wiki/sources/D.Lgs.%20138-2024%20(Decreto%20NIS).md?plain=1#L26</span>
</span>
</li>
<li id="fonte-3" data-testid="source" data-source="dlgs_138_2024_art_3_c_9">
<span>3</span>
<span>
<span>D.Lgs. 138/2024, art. 3 c. 9</span>
<span>Il decreto si applica ai soggetti degli Allegati I-IV individuati dall&#x27;ACN quando ricorre uno dei criteri del comma.</span>
<a class="print:hidden" href="https://github.com/AndreaTierno-stack/nis2-knowledge-it/blob/main/wiki/sources/D.Lgs.%20138-2024%20(Decreto%20NIS).md?plain=1#L31">Apri la scheda</a>
<span class="hidden print:block" data-testid="source-url">https://github.com/AndreaTierno-stack/nis2-knowledge-it/blob/main/wiki/sources/D.Lgs.%20138-2024%20(Decreto%20NIS).md?plain=1#L31</span>
</span>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
